{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55625","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 二十三 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 二十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沈沈竹院锁轻烟，淡淡霞光欲曙天，遇境偶吟情自逸，逢人话道意无偏。\n古松交处眠青帐，细草浓时坐碧毡。\n只此逍遥何所得，蔬食寒寝度年年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55625.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55625","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}